# Sidequest: Hunt the Mark (CR 603.4, 701.27, 712): when it enters, Bot1 destroys Bot2's Memnite; at the beginning of Bot1's end step
# a creature has died under an opponent's control, so Bot1 creates a Treasure (1; fewer than three, no transform). Turn 5 a Lightning
# Bolt kills Bot2's second Memnite: a second Treasure (2, still not transformed); turn 7 a third (3): the enchantment transforms into
# Yiazmat, Ultimate Mark, a 5/6 Dragon. Yiazmat's "{1}{B}, Sacrifice another creature or artifact" pays a Treasure's mana plus the
# Jet's {B}, sacrifices the other Treasure (not itself), and it gains indestructible and taps.

